tras/46a2552530641dc4cc882c96883ce984.poster.avif?t=1750399182\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225060/extras/46a2552530641dc4cc882c96883ce984.webm?t=1750399182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225060/extras/46a2552530641dc4cc882c96883ce984.mp4?t=1750399182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Features\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm Gameplay: Classic rhythm action\u2014follow the beat and let\u2019s groove!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succubus Seduction: Unlock intimate events through engaging systems and get ready for blush-inducing sweetness!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Growth: Take on gigs, go shopping, chat, and go on dates to boost your stats and unlock new stories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings: Your choices shape your path\u2014can you reach the sweetest ending?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225060/extras/9bd341944ca14acb930dc912353906a6.poster.avif?t=1750399182\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225060/extras/9bd341944ca14acb930dc912353906a6.webm?t=1750399182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225060/extras/9bd341944ca14acb930dc912353906a6.mp4?t=1750399182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225060/extras/1f215efb97636